      "steps": 0,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "content": "This exciting new text covers everything today's aspiring data scientist needs to know, managing to be comprehensive as well as accessible. Like a good confidence interval, the Gabors have got you almost completely covered!",
